{"id":"cai_da","lemma":"caída","pos":"noun","rank":2048,"glosses":["fall (act of falling)","crash (of a computer)","downfall"],"ipa":"/kaˈida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"caídas"},"order":2076,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ca%C3%ADda.wav","examples":[{"text":"La página web está caída.","en":"The website is down.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"web page"]]},{"text":"Cuanto más alto suban, más dura será la caída.","en":"The bigger they come, the harder they fall.","words":[{"g":"as much [of]"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"tall"},{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"hard","l":"duro"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Escuchamos la caída del árbol con un estruendo.","en":"We heard the tree fall with a crash.","words":[{"g":"to listen to","l":"escuchar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tree"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bang"}]}]}